From: mscharged-port native source preparation
Subject: [PATCH] Give original GX FIFO requests native EFB recorder ownership
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: permanent native GX command/submission hardware adaptation.

Explicitly arm original native GX before reconstructed module construction.
Consume actual FIFO requests with lazy real packets, preserving EFB Load at
native storage boundaries. Original finish opcodes require successful GPU
submission/device/future completion before existing owner PE delivery; actual
GXFlush publishes the completed FIFO prefix in this armed mode. Recycle native
packet storage without added game clears, frames, callbacks or VI presentation.
Keep historical diagnostic binary APIs and reject mixed recording ownership.
No Charged source or game initialization/render/swap algorithm is changed.
Compose after native selected-XFB output0032 on exactSDK29 provider preimages.

